## 🎯 Quick Reference Checklist

**Before writing code, verify:**
- [ ] Current working directory is identified
- [ ] Correct workspace rules are applied
- [ ] Using correct React elements (DOM vs Native)
- [ ] Using correct Supabase client pattern
- [ ] Using pnpm commands (not npm/yarn)
- [ ] TypeScript types are properly defined
- [ ] Styling approach matches workspace (Tailwind vs StyleSheet)
- [ ] Environment variables use correct prefix (`NEXT_PUBLIC_` vs `EXPO_PUBLIC_`)

**When bridging workspaces:**
- [ ] Leave agent notes with context
- [ ] Document API contracts
- [ ] Link related files
- [ ] Break down into workspace-specific tasks

---

**Remember: Context is everything. Always check where you are before you code.**
